What is Self-Attention? (The Short version) Self-Attention (SA) is a task to calculated query vectors, value vectors and key vectors from each input tokens, and Output tokens by Weighted-summing the cosine similarity of query vectors and key vectors, and value vectors.

▲ This short explanation make you hard to understand!

So let’s start from Dense or Feedforward layer of deep learning. Dense layer is building block of deep learning. Multiply weight matrix and input vector, and add the bias vector.

<Dense Layer Conceptual View (Left) and BERT Architecture (Right)>

The left picture shows a conceptual view of Dense layers, the right picture shows BERT model architecture which consists of 12 Transformer layers (refer to Implementation from Huggingface Team), and each of Transformer layer consists of 12 Self-Attention inputs (Hyper-parameters can be changed). When we apply MLP fully-connected network with a dataset, we can simply use dense layers, weights and bias.

<Self-Attention Layer Conceptual View>

To build Self-Attention Layer, let’s imagine the dense layer. Dense layers take 2 steps to generate output vector which consists of multiplication(matrix multiply) output, bias addition output. Multi Head Attention is a complex sum of 3 output layers, and one of them is, simply, a dense layer which called feed forward layer or position-wise feed forward layer. Let’s make one thing clear. The contents of this article show fundamentals of self-attention, please don’t think of this as a mathematics and keep looking for a connection with it.

# Fully-Connected Layer and Attention Formulation (Advanced Version)

The Fully Connected layers have bias vector, weight to span into higher dimension. The problem is, unlike images that possess previous information, word is an independent symbols and it does not matter where it is located, so Deep Learning engineers had to find some methods to connect each symbol to make understanding and it was solved by introducing of Attention mechanism.

# Before going to details of self-attention mechanism, what is Attention?

Attention is attention , not CNN’s RCNN that follows objects and Seq-2-Seq’s Attention that just emphasizes the presence of a token. Attention focus on a particular section of the tokens. Instead of emphasizing on a particular section, Self-attention decides where to calculate relation among words, and decide which section is related to each words.

In Seq-2-Seq’s attention, the decoder predict a word at the next time step, if the model inputs sentence like “A dog is sleeping in a house like a man of god”. The model will predict “God” as most related word. This can be very misleading because “God” is not related to “dog” but it sounds like “dog”. Self Attention stands on a step forward process, which decides which words are related and choose how much to intensify for each word.

▲ Usually, in neural networks that process natural language in order, the input sequence appear bottom to top. However, In Self-Attention model, the input come from any directions (Rows in a matrix), and information flow from left to right of the matrix.

T gets the symbols from left to right of the matrix, value vectors and key vectors get information by rows of the matrix. Key-value shapes are parameters to decide intensity of attention at the end of the operations, the both paramaters seems meaningless but it is uniquness of the concept of self-attention. Key and value vectors are free to move in any column. At this point, let’s imagine the values are mounted on an cart which travels to the value vectors, value vectors select key-value of attention at a particular location, and calculate interaction between the selected key-value and all the Query(T) in the matrix. Using this process, self attention model receives attention in a matrix view.

