    the weight state_dict of each adapter (see here for when adapters are used),
    and a key specifying the name of the classification head to use for computing the loss (this key may correspond to a task in the list of adapters or a regular head of a pre-trained model - then it is not necessarily a substring of one of the keys in the dictionary under which the weights are stored).
tf_model.h5 file (if the model is also exported to TensorFlow).
