Below is the generate ANSI standard random number kernel. It takes 4 arguments- a pointer to an array, the length of the array, a pointer to a vector of seeds, and the size of this vector of seeds. The code uses the MT19937 random number generator developed by Matsumoto and Nishimura [1]

