1 – Scalable Production Grade Deployment : Much easier to develop pipelines in a way where jobs are separated and there is data locality. The model developer require not configure any additional parameters except the features and label selection variable selection. The framework should allow users to configure multiple jobs as a single training run and run through logs and reports separately.

2 – learnability : The framework should detect the presence of categorical versus non categorical data, and be able to present a score which can help us understand data quality . It should remember a list of features that were key to the transformation and it should present them as part of loss or weight vector.

