Within each topic area (text, imagery, design, videos, audio, page layout), Attention Insight checks the impact of each element. You receive comprehensive coverage for each element. As seen in this image, each element is visible for a specific amount of time, some generate higher fixation time (higher retention value), and eyetracking data is mapped to the mouse cursor. By selecting the Fixations tab you see exactly where people looked and what most caught their attention.

