It’s critical to note that it just takes one Ethan Mollick to stir the AI ethics debate wave pool.

Ethan Mollick is a Professor at the Wharton School of the University of Pennsylvania, where he studies and teaches innovation and entrepreneurship. As a curious academic Ethan Mollick has become the first known person to discovered that OpenAI’s GPT-3 generative language prediction model can be used for malicious purposes.

